  "data": [
    {
      "abstract": "The $B_c$ meson production (pp-equivalent) cross-section times branching fraction of the $B_c\\rightarrow (J/\\psi \\rightarrow \\mu\\mu) \\mu \\nu_{\\mu}$ decay in pp and PbPb collisions. The used kinematic variables correspond to those of the trimuon final state. The two $p_T$ bins correspond to different rapidity ranges. The total uncertainty is decomposed in an uncertainty from the fit and one representing all other sources. The markers of the $p_T^{\\mu\\mu\\mu}$ bins are placed according to the Lafferty-Wyatt prescription.",
